---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Support the Monastery">
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Context Callout -->
      <div class="surface-card p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 space-y-6">
        <div class="badge badge-crimson">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          Monastic Sangha Support
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display text-ink font-normal">
          Direct Support for Monastic Living & Education
        </h2>

        <p class="lead text-base sm:text-lg text-muted">
          Main Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling is home to over one hundred monks from Tibet, Mongolia, and the remote Himalayan border regions of India.
        </p>

        <p class="text-ink">
          The monastery provides complete room, board, healthcare, and an eighteen-year philosophical and meditative education free of charge to all enrolled students. Many monks arrive from impoverished families or remote communities lacking educational infrastructure, with twelve young orphans from Mongolia under full monastic care.
        </p>

        <p class="text-ink">
          The monastery relies entirely on voluntary contributions and charitable patrons to cover the daily costs of nutritious meals, building repairs in the Himalayan climate, winter heating, and medical treatment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Methods of Giving Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Bank Transfer Card -->
        <div class="surface-card p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 border-l-4 border-l-accent">
          <div>
            <div class="badge badge-saffron mb-4">International & Domestic Wire</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display text-ink mb-2">Direct Bank Transfer</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-6">
              Wire donations directly to the official registered society account in India. For domestic transfers within India, donations support the monastery under charitable trust regulations.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle p-4 border border-border text-sm font-mono">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:justify-between py-1 border-b border-border/60">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold">Account Name</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-ink text-right">Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling Cultural Society</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-border/60">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold">Bank Name</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-ink">State Bank of India</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-1 border-b border-border/60">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold">Account No.</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-accent">4008 4616 933</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-border/60">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold">SWIFT Code</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-ink">SBININBB104</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1 border-b border-border/60">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold">IFSC Code</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-ink">SBIN 0000 691</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between py-1">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold">Branch Code</span>
                <span class="font-semibold text-ink">00691 (The Mall, Shimla)</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-muted">
            After initiating a transfer, please send a brief notification email with your transfer reference to <a href="mailto:office@jonangmonastery.com" class="text-accent underline font-semibold">office@jonangmonastery.com</a> so our administration office may issue a formal receipt.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Cheque / Postal Donation Card -->
        <div class="surface-card p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 border-l-4 border-l-accent-secondary">
          <div>
            <div class="badge badge-neutral mb-4">Postal Draft</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display text-ink mb-2">Cheque & Postal Delivery</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-6">
              Cheques or bank drafts should be drawn in favor of the registered cultural society and mailed to our office address in Shimla.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-subtle p-4 border border-border text-sm">
              <div>
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold block mb-1">Payable To</span>
                <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling Cultural Society</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pt-2 border-t border-border/60">
                <span class="text-muted text-xs uppercase font-sans font-semibold block mb-1">Postal Address</span>
                <address class="not-italic text-ink leading-relaxed font-sans text-sm">
                  Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling Tibetan Buddhist Monastery<br />
                  Sanjauli, Shimla, Himachal Pradesh<br />
                  PIN: 171006, India
                </address>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Contact Coordinates -->
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-border">
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-2">Direct Monastery Inquiries</h4>
            <div class="text-sm text-ink space-y-1">
              <div><strong>Office Telephone:</strong> +91 177 2841410</div>
              <div><strong>Mobile / Line:</strong> +91 177 2645280</div>
              <div><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:office@jonangmonastery.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">office@jonangmonastery.com</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Transparency Note -->
      <div class="callout text-sm text-muted">
        <strong>Specific Dedications:</strong> If you wish your contribution to be allocated toward a particular project—such as monk medical care, kitchen provisions, winter heating, or student study materials—please specify your intention in your bank transfer memo or accompanying email. Every donation is used strictly for its designated monastic purpose.
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
